l up every stat.Balance tweaks. We tightened the screws so you can survive.Grab the demo, serve your sentence and tell us how it went. Every comment and review helps us make Hoosegow better before release.Respect from the whole cellblock if you tak","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:04:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692036","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4060640-1842846814447019","game_id":"steam-4060640","kind":"announcement","title":"Hoosegow: Prison Survival Demo Is Out on Parole!","summary":"Hey folks! The Hoosegow: Prison Survival demo just broke out.Thanks to everyone who took part in the playtests — based on your feedback we tuned the balance, added new event types, and even threw in a couple of features we hadn't originally planned.The demo includes the Classic mode and roughly 15% of the game's content. All the progress you earn in the demo carries over to the full version and will help unlock skills and character cards.Got feedback or suggestions? Come find us in our communiti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T15:55:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447019","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4060640-1839676055890339","game_id":"steam-4060640","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest is now live!","summary":"Thanks to everyone who signed up — applications have been reviewed, and the playtest for Hoosegow: Prison Survival is officially open.Click PLAY to jump into the full playtest build.A few notes: ● After you've played a session, please take a few minutes to fill out the in-game survey — your feedback directly shapes what we fix and improve next. ● Honest feedback is genuinely more useful than positive feedback, so don't hold back if something felt off, unclear, or unbalanced.If you didn't get an ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T09:10:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055890339","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4060640-1835236783569640","game_id":"steam-4060640","kind":"announcement","title":"Dressed for the Sentence","summary":"We spent a long time thinking about how to dress our inmates. We considered options: business formal, casual, maybe something from Gucci. In the end, we arrived at the one true answer — stripes.Yes, that timeless classic. Black and white, horizontal, for people who now have plenty of time on their hands.We developed a full lineup: a tank top for those who work out in the yard; a polo for the white-collar guys who embezzled their way in; a button-up shirt — strictly for those who still consider t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T09:48:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783569640","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4060640-1826992588589911","game_id":"steam-4060640","kind":"announcement","title":"We've finished work on the PC UI","summary":"If you played the mobile version of Hoosegow — you won't recognize the game. This is not a port and not a visual refresh. We rethought every screen for monitors and gamepad, and the result is a completely different experience. The game is deeper, more informative, and more intuitive — you now have everything you need to make informed decisions instead of acting on blind luck.The mobile version was built for quick sessions and a small screen. The PC version is a different pace and a different lev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-11T12:48:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588589911","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4060640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4060640":"2026-10-26T11:23:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4060640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:19Z"},"4764240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:19Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4060640","app_id":4060640,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"ac1c32ab30480f27add6f350cc41e7838d4198f3191c6ad86e9f06c09edb2593","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Hoosegow — 철창 안 삶을 그린 블랙 코미디. 무작위 죄수, 무작위 혐의, 무작위 형량. 목표는 단 하나, 어떤 대가를 치르더라도 살아남는 것. 모든 선택은 새로운 길을 열거나 죽음으로 이어집니다.","publishers":[{"name":"D.Dream games"}],"developers":[{"name":"D.Dream games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793196000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Hoosegow","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791463922","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4060640/1519714887/ccf333a9e65e34371eca25b64ce123bcac